45-- Symptom: `verify-jgun-opening.mjs` reports "shader link failure or context loss" with zero shader failures -> cause: it counts the deliberate WebGL2 probe canvas at ~line 52 -> fix: check `isConnected` before counting; do not misclassify the harness false positive as renderer failure. [Task 2]
46-- Symptom: reduced-motion checkpoints say "scroll/camera did not settle" -> cause: Lenis/ScrollTrigger do not mount, while the harness settle loop (~lines 92–118) assumes they do -> fix the reduced-motion harness path. Separately fix the real inconsistency: camera parks at `t=0.4` while `DrawingLinework.tsx` and `TorqueWrenchHero.tsx` park at `t=0.2`; define `REDUCED_MOTION_INTRO_T = 0.4` in `introTimeline.ts` and test `focus=1`, `pulse=0`, `pbr=0`. [Task 2]
