  report.cases.push(result)
  const subResults = []
...
    const sub = { name: 'reduced-motion-static', gates: ['V4'], errors: [], warnings: [], requests: [], failures: [], measures: {} }
    report.cases.push(sub)
    subResults.push(sub)
...
    const sub = { name: 'poster-static', gates: ['V4'], errors: [], warnings: [], requests: [], failures: [], measures: {} }
    report.cases.push(sub)
    subResults.push(sub)
```
Wait! Look at the previous `report.json` that was already in `lifecycle/report.json`:
Why did it mix several partial runs? Because maybe the script was aborted or someone appended, or `runCase` pushed multiple times!
