Let's see: `verify-ring-inspection.mjs` defines `seek` as:
```js
const seek = async (page, time, entryElapsed = 2) => {
  await page.evaluate(({ time, entryElapsed }) => window.__inspectionProof.seek(time, entryElapsed), { time, entryElapsed });
  await page.waitForTimeout(250);
  return read(page)
}
```
And in `verify-ring-inspection.mjs`:
```js
await page.waitForFunction(() => window.__inspection?.loaded && window.__inspectionProof, null, { timeout: 60000 })
```
